==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|BREAKthrough|Starly|125}} from the {{TCG|BREAKthrough}} expansion.
*'''Call for Family''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Jungle|Bellsprout|49}} and {{TCG ID|Jungle|Nidoran♀|57}}, both from the {{TCG|Jungle}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Violet}}.

